  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 2019900,
      "startingMessageId": [
        201990000
      ],
      "messages": {
        "201990000": {
          "id": 201990000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "Pardon me, {M#Mr.}{F#Miss} {NICKNAME}",
          "next": [
            201990001
          ]
        },
        "201990001": {
          "id": 201990001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "Do you still recall the two little chimeras I adopted? I found out they love falling asleep to fairy tales",
          "next": [
            201990002
          ]
        },
        "201990002": {
          "id": 201990002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "I've been thinking about exploring some new directions lately, so I'm planning to try writing",
          "next": [
            201990003,
            201990004
          ]
        },
        "201990003": {
          "id": 201990003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "So what kind of new story do we have this time?",
          "next": [
            201990006
          ]
        },
        "201990004": {
          "id": 201990004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Do I have a part in this?",
          "next": [
            201990005
          ]
        },
        "201990005": {
          "id": 201990005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "Shouldn't be a problem",
          "next": [
            201990006
          ]
        },
        "201990006": {
          "id": 201990006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "Actually, I was just about to ask for your opinion. Here's what I have in mind:",
          "next": [
            201990007
          ]
        },
        "201990007": {
          "id": 201990007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "The protagonist accidentally enters a small town inhabited by cats and mice, singing crows, pink piglets, and a cooperative ant family",
          "next": [
            201990008
          ]
        },
        "201990008": {
          "id": 201990008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "They're quite sociable, love playing with the protagonist, and really enjoy listening to stories",
          "next": [
            201990009
          ]
        },
        "201990009": {
          "id": 201990009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "No, they love those stories very, very much...",
          "next": [
            201990010
          ]
        },
        "201990010": {
          "id": 201990010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "When the fairy tale town enters deep night and everything quiets down... the little animals just can't fall asleep...",
          "next": [
            201990011
          ]
        },
        "201990011": {
          "id": 201990011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "\"It can't be quiet here,\" \"It can't be quiet here,\" they said...",
          "next": [
            201990012
          ]
        },
        "201990012": {
          "id": 201990012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "And so, they came to the protagonist's bedside",
          "next": [
            201990013
          ]
        },
        "201990013": {
          "id": 201990013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "And just like that",
          "next": [
            201990014
          ]
        },
        "201990014": {
          "id": 201990014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "●_●",
          "next": [
            201990015
          ]
        },
        "201990015": {
          "id": 201990015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "◕_◕",
          "next": [
            201990016
          ]
        },
        "201990016": {
          "id": 201990016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "◐‿◑",
          "next": [
            201990017
          ]
        },
        "201990017": {
          "id": 201990017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "They stare at you",
          "next": [
            201990018,
            201990021,
            201990024
          ]
        },
        "201990018": {
          "id": 201990018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Is this what you call a \"fairy tale\"? That's terrifying!",
          "next": [
            201990019
          ]
        },
        "201990019": {
          "id": 201990019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "Ah, is it really terrifying?",
          "next": [
            201990020
          ]
        },
        "201990020": {
          "id": 201990020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "To be honest, as I was writing, I realized this topic might be better suited for a horror novel",
          "next": [
            201990027
          ]
        },
        "201990021": {
          "id": 201990021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Gotta admit, it's pretty cute",
          "next": [
            201990022
          ]
        },
        "201990022": {
          "id": 201990022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "To be honest, as I was writing, I realized this topic might be better suited for a horror novel",
          "next": [
            201990023
          ]
        },
        "201990023": {
          "id": 201990023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "But judging from your reaction, I'm afraid the horror elements aren't quite enough",
          "next": [
            201990027
          ]
        },
        "201990024": {
          "id": 201990024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "So where is that quiet place?",
          "next": [
            201990025
          ]
        },
        "201990025": {
          "id": 201990025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "As expected, your focus is always so... unique",
          "next": [
            201990026
          ]
        },
        "201990026": {
          "id": 201990026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "To be honest, as I was writing, I realized this topic might be better suited for a horror novel",
          "next": [
            201990027
          ]
        },
        "201990027": {
          "id": 201990027,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "next": [
            201990028
          ]
        },
        "201990028": {
          "id": 201990028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "I'm not that well-versed in horror novels, so to better immerse myself, I looked up some reference books, like <i>20 Unsolved Mysteries</i> and <i>The Many Causes of Disappearances</i>...",
          "next": [
            201990029
          ]
        },
        "201990029": {
          "id": 201990029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "I just finished reading <i>Eat Well</i> today and got some pretty good ideas from it",
          "next": [
            201990030
          ]
        },
        "201990030": {
          "id": 201990030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "I'll come back to discuss with you once I make some progress",
          "next": [
            201990031
          ]
        },
        "201990031": {
          "id": 201990031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "Don't worry, the little chimeras will pester me daily for updates. They just can't live without stories!",
          "next": [
            201990032
          ]
        },
        "201990032": {
          "id": 201990032,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "next": []
        }
      },
